dation and rule checks.\n    return status\n```\n\nPrevious proposed answer:\n```python\ndef test_analyze_orders_valid_input():\n    result = analyze_orders(age=25, items=3, total=50.0)\n    assert result == \"accepted\"\n```\n\nValidation error:\nThe response still contains placeholders or explanatory text. Use the exact concrete names and values from the provided source code.", "response": "```python\ndef test_analyze_orders_valid_input():\n    result = analyze_orders(age=25, items=3, total=50.0)\n    assert result == \"accepted\"\n```", "duration_sec": 20.964}
