e result even if the order\n    # was already classified as accepted or as needing review.\n    if items == 0:\n        status = \"empty_order\"\n\n    # Return the final classification after all validation and rule checks.\n    return status\n```", "response": "```python\ndef test_analyze_orders_negative_total():\n    \"\"\"\n    Test that an order with a negative total is classified as rejected,\n    even if the age is 18 or more and there are items in the order.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = analyze_orders(20, 5, -50)\n    assert result == \"rejected\"\n```", "duration_sec": 51.4079}
