r:\n```python\ndef test_analyze_orders_single_item_with_age_and_total_boundary():\n    result = analyze_orders(age=18, items=1, total=100.0)\n    assert result == \"needs_review\"\n```\n\nValidation error:\nAssertionError: assert 'accepted' == 'needs_review'", "response": "```python\ndef test_analyze_orders_single_item_with_age_and_total_boundary():\n    result = analyze_orders(age=18, items=1, total=100.0)\n    assert result == \"needs_review\"\n```", "duration_sec": 7.1334}
